          %h2#references References
          %p
            The standard rules for type-formation, term introduction/elimination and computation of dependent product type are listed for instance in
            %a{:href => "http://www.math.unipa.it/~ngambino/Research/Lectures/lecture1.pdf"} part I
            of
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Nicola+Gambino"}> Nicola Gambino
              ,
              %em Lectures on dependent type theory
              (
              %a{:href => "http://www.cs.le.ac.uk/events/mgs2009/courses/gambino/lecturenotes-gambino.pdf"}> pdf
              )
          %p Another textbook account could be found in section 2.1 of:
          %ul
            %li#Rijke22
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Egbert+Rijke"}> Egbert Rijke
              ,
